      </p>
      <p>In order to find the closed-loop equations, we have to look at how the input, <img class="inline_eqn" src="Content/MotorPosition/Control/StateSpace/html/MotorPosition_ControlStateSpace_eq11776305044305525613.png" alt="$u$">, affects the plant. In this case, it affects the system in exactly the same manner as in the unaugmented equations except
