% <http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/place.html |place|> , 
% <http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/step.html |step|> 
%
%%
% From the main problem, the dynamic equations in state-space form are
% given below.
